<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT 1st qtr net dips to 1.28 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>PLDT 1st qtr net dips to 1.28 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)   8.81 vs 9.20</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	     7.37 vs 6.57</p>
<p>    Net income (billion)	   1.28 vs 1.31</p>
<p>Note: Full name Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co. Dominant telecommunications company in the Philippines.</p>
</text>
